WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.722
One day a poor man came to visit an effendi while he was having tea.

2
00:00:05.723 --> 00:00:11.817
Effendi is a title of respect for a well-educated or wealthy man in the Middle East.

3
00:00:11.818 --> 00:00:17.134
The poor man said, "Effendi Nasreddin, I need your help.

4
00:00:17.135 --> 00:00:24.699
I don't know if you will help me. I am a poor man, a man with no money."

5
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:30.550
The effendi looked at the man kindly. "I will help you," he said.

6
00:00:30.551 --> 00:00:32.487
"Tell me, what is wrong?"

7
00:00:32.488 --> 00:00:38.015
The poor man looked tired and hungry, and it took him a while to begin.

8
00:00:38.016 --> 00:00:41.773
"I have a problem. . ." He paused

9
00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:48.544
suddenly. "Yes," said the effendi gently, "go

10
00:00:48.545 --> 00:00:54.878
on." "Yesterday I stopped in front of the door of a restaurant," the poor man

11
00:00:54.879 --> 00:00:59.134
said. "The restaurant belonged to a rich man. I ate

12
00:00:59.135 --> 00:01:04.609
nothing. I only smelled the food. However, the owner came out and noticed

13
00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:14.273
me. He said I was enjoying his food, and . . . and . . . he wanted me to pay him for the

14
00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:18.880
food." The poor man stopped. He turned his head and

15
00:01:18.881 --> 00:01:25.398
coughed. The effendi wondered if the man was crying, but he waited patiently for the man to

16
00:01:25.399 --> 00:01:31.457
continue. "Please, finish your story when you are ready," said the

17
00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:34.809
effendi. "Well," continued the poor

18
00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:39.807
man. "I, of course, had no money with me, so I couldn't pay

19
00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:45.366
him. He became very angry. He shouted and shouted until the judge

20
00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:48.369
came. The judge said I must appear in court

21
00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:51.328
today. He will tell me how I am to be

22
00:01:51.329 --> 00:01:56.477
punished. Please, effendi," begged the poor man, "can you help

23
00:01:56.478 --> 00:02:01.140
me? Can you say something to the

24
00:02:01.141 --> 00:02:07.059
judge?" The effendi offered the man some tea, and he sat thinking quietly while the man

25
00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.774
drank. When the man had finished his tea, the effendi

26
00:02:10.775 --> 00:02:18.529
spoke: "Yes, I will go to court with you. Let's go." And they left together.

27
00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:24.493
When the effendi and the poor man got to court, the rich man was already there.

28
00:02:24.494 --> 00:02:26.468
He was waiting for them.

29
00:02:26.469 --> 00:02:35.773
As soon as the rich man saw the poor man, he began shouting angrily, "This man owes me the price of one dinner!

30
00:02:35.774 --> 00:02:40.318
I want my money! These beggars are all alike!

31
00:02:40.319 --> 00:02:44.037
They live off the work of others!"

32
00:02:44.038 --> 00:02:47.894
It took the judge several minutes to calm the rich man down.

33
00:02:47.895 --> 00:02:51.950
"You see how angry he is?" said the judge.

34
00:02:51.951 --> 00:02:56.031
"You have filled yourself up on the smell of his restaurant.

35
00:02:56.032 --> 00:03:01.850
Yet you have not even paid him. You must pay him right now."

36
00:03:01.851 --> 00:03:06.568
After the effendi heard what the judge said, he stepped forward.

37
00:03:06.569 --> 00:03:12.381
He looked at the rich man and said, "Oh, sir, do not be so upset.

38
00:03:12.382 --> 00:03:15.780
This poor man is my brother, my elder brother.

39
00:03:15.781 --> 00:03:22.138
He is a poor man and he cannot pay you, so I will pay you instead."

40
00:03:22.139 --> 00:03:26.528
After he heard this, the rich man smiled a greedy smile.

41
00:03:26.529 --> 00:03:29.880
The effendi took a bag of coins from his belt.

42
00:03:29.881 --> 00:03:34.047
He bent down next to the rich man and shook the bag of coins.

43
00:03:34.048 --> 00:03:37.333
The coins jingled loudly.

44
00:03:37.334 --> 00:03:41.585
"Listen," said the effendi. "Do you hear that sound?"

45
00:03:41.586 --> 00:03:46.119
"Of course I hear!" said the rich man impatiently.

46
00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:50.557
"Well, then," answered the effendi, "the problem is solved.

47
00:03:50.558 --> 00:03:52.284
The debt is paid.

48
00:03:52.285 --> 00:03:56.514
My brother has smelled your food, and you have heard his money."

49
00:03:56.515 --> 00:04:01.503
The judge nodded. He was satisfied with the exchange.

50
00:04:01.504 --> 00:04:08.708
If the poor man only smelled the rich man's food, the rich man could only charge him the sound of his money.

51
00:04:08.709 --> 00:04:15.050
Afterward, the effendi took the arm of the poor man and handed him the bag of gold coins.

52
00:04:15.051 --> 00:04:21.309
"Go, my brother," said the effendi, "and taste the food you have smelled so much of."

53
00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:26.428
The poor man bowed respectfully and left.

